  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu Australia Infrastructure for Development (VAI4D)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vanuatu-Australia Infrastructure for Development investment aims to support Vanuatu&apos;s Ministry of Infrastructure and Public Utilities (MIPU), to achieve sustainable and well-maintained infrastructure and services for all, through inclusive and effective partnerships. The investment aims to support 1.) MIPU&apos;s Public Works  Department to manage Vanuatu&#x2019;s public roads network effectively and efficiently, 2.) MIPU to use improved systems, processes, and technologies, and 3.) Government of Vanuatu agencies to deliver infrastructure portfolios and projects more coherently, effectively, and efficiently, in coordination with Government of Australia partners.</narrative>
  </description>
